12	// And the user's crew total: the due-totals of the crews that person leads, added up; nothing when
13	// they lead none. And the count of REVIEW claims assigned to the user for review. And the user's
14	// watched total: the due-totals of the people they watch, added up (n/a skipped; 0.00 for no one).
