374	    /** The sheet's ancestors as they stood at the end of the date: its parent as last set by then (none when never set by
375	     *  then), that sheet's parent as last set by then, and so on, up to {@link Rates#ANCESTOR_LEVELS} levels up; then a clone's
376	     *  source and its own ancestors, in turn (see {@link Rates#chain}). A parent set before its history was kept counts as
377	     *  of any date. */
378	    public List<String> ancestors(String sheetId, LocalDate date) {
379	        return Rates.chain(sheetId, at -> parentOn(at, date), sheets::source);
