113	    /** A claim's due from its figure (the rate figure): the figure raised to the floor in force on its date, with the late
114	     *  charge worked on that floored figure on top. A settled due, and the due a statement bound (its figure), are kept as they are; a correction has
115	     *  no floor and no charge; null stays null. */
116	    public static BigDecimal due(Claim claim, BigDecimal figure, BigDecimal floor, Function<LocalDate, BigDecimal> pct,
117	            LocalDate today, RoundingMode rounding) {
118	        return due(claim, figure, floor, pct, today, rounding, 0);
119	    }
